WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.610 --> 00:00:01.831
- Oh God.

00:00:01.831 --> 00:00:03.030
(audience laughing)

00:00:03.030 --> 00:00:04.223
I'd like to explain.

00:00:05.472 --> 00:00:06.305
It's...

00:00:06.305 --> 00:00:09.130
Sadly, I'd like to say
the one with the tiny hat

00:00:09.130 --> 00:00:11.563
which by the way was
from Barbie western wear.

00:00:12.540 --> 00:00:15.320
I'd love to say it was
a joke or a character.

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:16.420
It wasn't.

00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:19.000
I was told if I, when I got to LA

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.910
because I'd only done plays in New York.

00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:21.890
And I met with...

00:00:21.890 --> 00:00:25.230
I finally was like, I'm
getting a commercial agent.

00:00:25.230 --> 00:00:27.870
They're like, I wasn't but I
was going to meet with someone.

00:00:27.870 --> 00:00:29.920
And he said if you
wanna work in this town,

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:31.580
you've gotta do character shots.

00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:35.770
And I was like, oh I think
those make me uncomfortable.

00:00:35.770 --> 00:00:37.890
I said is that when someone's
like in a cop jacket

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:39.320
and then the next thing
they're the burglar.

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:41.830
And I was like, I don't, I
don't think I wanna do that.

00:00:41.830 --> 00:00:43.350
And he's like, well then
you don't wanna work

00:00:43.350 --> 00:00:45.020
and you can't work with me.

00:00:45.020 --> 00:00:47.220
But I didn't know it
was supposed to be like

00:00:48.090 --> 00:00:49.490
things you may get cast as.

00:00:49.490 --> 00:00:51.330
Like a waitress or a cop.

00:00:51.330 --> 00:00:52.163
- [Kelly] Yeah.

00:00:52.163 --> 00:00:53.140
- So I went to do that headshot

00:00:53.140 --> 00:00:55.260
and I was like, this is Carol.

00:00:55.260 --> 00:00:57.501
She works at a Bonds.

00:00:57.501 --> 00:00:58.334
(audience laughs)

00:00:58.334 --> 00:01:00.320
She says what you can't
see is under the picture

00:01:00.320 --> 00:01:04.181
I'm holding a plastic tray
with Velveeta slices on it.

00:01:04.181 --> 00:01:05.290
(audience laughs)

00:01:05.290 --> 00:01:06.150
And I had a whole thing.

00:01:06.150 --> 00:01:07.940
I was like, she works in a grocery store

00:01:07.940 --> 00:01:08.773
at the end of an aisle.

00:01:08.773 --> 00:01:10.570
And she passes out cheese samples.

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:11.880
- [Kelly] She's about
to whip up some Rotel.

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:14.290
- And I brought this back to my agent.

00:01:14.290 --> 00:01:16.381
And he was like, what the hell is this?

00:01:16.381 --> 00:01:17.530
(audience laughs)

00:01:17.530 --> 00:01:19.220
He's like, what does this mean to anyone?

00:01:19.220 --> 00:01:20.220
I'm like, I don't know.

00:01:20.220 --> 00:01:21.255
I said I didn't wanna do it.

00:01:21.255 --> 00:01:22.088
- But it stands out.

00:01:22.088 --> 00:01:22.921
It stands out.

00:01:22.921 --> 00:01:23.990
- Unfortunately, sure did.

00:01:23.990 --> 00:01:26.130
No one ever calls me in on that.

00:01:26.130 --> 00:01:27.270
Because I look crazy.

00:01:27.270 --> 00:01:28.310
- Their loss.
- Their loss.

00:01:28.310 --> 00:01:29.317
- That's what I say.

